			"Message": "chore(Project): Update Element submodule to a7b5aff343560a506c0972c8bf1bd41d87144760\n\nSynchronize Element submodule reference from b9aba51b to a7b5aff. This pulls in the latest coordinated changes across the Element components.\n\nThe new commit completes the explicit module path migration in Mountain's state and IPC layer by:\n- Adding explicit TextProcessing segment in DocumentStateDTO import for AnalyzeTextLinesAndEOL\n- Prefixing ConfigurationState, UIState, and WorkspaceState type paths with their module name (e.g., UIState::UIState::State)\n- Updating WorkspaceDelta function signatures with full WorkspaceState::WorkspaceState::State paths\n- Migrating AppLifecycle call site to WindServiceHandlers::Utilities::set_static_application_root\n\nThis continues the refactoring from 10feb14ec to eliminate implicit module namespace reliance, making dependency relationships explicit in every call site.",
